  3. **Varargs removes 8, maybe 9, of the 17.** With the stand-in the measure printed 10 refused and 747 emitted, against 18 and 742 before. Two of the ten stop at another wall: `Generator2` ('Error trying to close method scope', not traced) and `CatString` (an operator's application, perhaps varargs' own path).
